/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Olewin Academy is a premier learning platform founded by IIT alumni, committed to nurturing talent through a structured and holistic learning approach. We provide foundation-level training for students from 8th to 10th grade, focusing on building strong fundamentals, and advanced-level programs for 11th and 12th graders, designed to prepare them for competitive exams and future careers. Our specialized coaching includes programs for IIT-JEE, NEET-UG & PG, GRE, TOEFL, FMGE, and guidance for abroad admissions. Additionally, we offer an extensive range of software courses, tailored to equip learners with the latest industry-relevant skills.  At Olewin Academy, we empower students to achieve academic and professional excellence.)
/E (Olewin Academy is a premier learning platform founded by IIT alumni, committed to nurturing talent through a structured and holistic learning approach. We provide foundation-level training for students from 8th to 10th grade, focusing on building strong fundamentals, and advanced-level programs for 11th and 12th graders, designed to prepare them for competitive exams and future careers. Our specialized coaching includes programs for IIT-JEE, NEET-UG & PG, GRE, TOEFL, FMGE, and guidance for abroad admissions. Additionally, we offer an extensive range of software courses, tailored to equip learners with the latest industry-relevant skills.  At Olewin Academy, we empower students to achieve academic and professional excellence.)
